# Fixture: an editable-field edit site and an entry hook write — write-site
# categories outside the handler-set coordinate.
precept EditableFixture

field Limit as decimal default 100.0

rule Limit <= 1000 because "cap"

state Active initial
state Closed terminal

in Active modify Limit editable

to Closed -> set Limit = 0

event Open initial
on Open -> set Limit = 50

event Close
from Active on Close -> transition Closed
